      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt: Per-File Encryption",
      "source_hash": 16257748915178500896,
      "context_hash": 4344248223121263096,
      "translation": "fscrypt: 파일 단위 암호화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화",
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Key hierarchy, HKDF derivation, and transparent encryption in ext4/F2FS/Btrfs",
      "source_hash": 13414781694778548864,
      "context_hash": 5343966223656316494,
      "translation": "ext4/F2FS/Btrfs의 키 계층 구조, HKDF 유도, 투명 암호화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "btrfs": "btrfs",
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230597Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 1935161266032719602,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt provides **per-directory** transparent encryption at the VFS layer.",
      "source_hash": 13417656670338585887,
      "context_hash": 12835613376502462207,
      "translation": "fscrypt는 VFS 계층에서 **디렉터리 단위** 투명 암호화를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS",
        "encryption": "암호화",
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Unlike dm-crypt (full disk), fscrypt encrypts individual files and directories, allowing:",
      "source_hash": 14394946573364715049,
      "context_hash": 16466204069316116890,
      "translation": "dm-crypt(전체 디스크)와 달리 fscrypt는 개별 파일과 디렉터리를 암호화하므로 다음이 가능합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dm-crypt": "dm-crypt",
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Multiple users to have separate encrypted directories with different keys",
      "source_hash": 13859628017173147026,
      "context_hash": 5129838371382672986,
      "translation": "여러 사용자가 서로 다른 키로 각자의 암호화된 디렉터리를 소유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Selective encryption (not all files need to be encrypted)",
      "source_hash": 6064891520158176185,
      "context_hash": 3587707014459187481,
      "translation": "선택적 암호화(모든 파일을 암호화할 필요 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Fast key revocation (remove key → files become inaccessible)",
      "source_hash": 1996773286624034087,
      "context_hash": 2245594956287624708,
      "translation": "빠른 키 폐기(키 제거 → 파일 접근 불가)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported filesystems: **ext4, F2FS, UBIFS, Btrfs** (5.14+)",
      "source_hash": 7532165063467501685,
      "context_hash": 10628677652042449746,
      "translation": "지원 파일시스템: **ext4, F2FS, UBIFS, Btrfs** (5.14+)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "btrfs": "btrfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key hierarchy",
      "source_hash": 7363092601445137992,
      "context_hash": 11452840087388911818,
      "translation": "키 계층 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "fscrypt uses a two-level key hierarchy:",
      "source_hash": 14557165677115840693,
      "context_hash": 4043203791561305961,
      "translation": "fscrypt는 2단계 키 계층 구조를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fscrypt": "fscrypt"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Each encrypted directory has a **policy** that records:",
      "source_hash": 2126402944448175388,
      "context_hash": 13410152062478037802,
      "translation": "암호화된 각 디렉터리에는 다음을 기록하는 **정책**이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Which master key to use (by key descriptor or key identifier)",
      "source_hash": 16765467138354643218,
      "context_hash": 2489360530348757528,
      "translation": "사용할 마스터 키(키 디스크립터 또는 키 식별자로 지정)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Which encryption mode (AES-256-XTS for contents, AES-256-CTS for filenames)",
      "source_hash": 10685684526013527577,
      "context_hash": 18149260304997626382,
      "translation": "암호화 모드(내용에는 AES-256-XTS, 파일 이름에는 AES-256-CTS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "encryption": "암호화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Key derivation version (v1 trusted keyring, v2 HKDF)",
      "source_hash": 12105264249486094385,
      "context_hash": 15207875545724708310,
      "translation": "키 유도 버전(v1 trusted keyring, v2 HKDF)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.230598Z",
